== B  H3: layer-A binding (s3_lint_v6)
  object with keys, pos 0, layer_a={0}                 -> CAUGHT
  keys stripped, pos 0, layer_a={0}                    -> CAUGHT
  keys renamed, pos 0, layer_a={0}                     -> CAUGHT
  no working_label, pos 0, layer_a={0}                 -> CAUGHT
  keys stripped, pos 1 (register slot), layer_a={0}    -> missed
  object-shaped record in register slot, layer_a={0}   -> CAUGHT
  keys stripped, layer_a=() (key sniffing only)        -> missed
  verifier call site: final_records = [obj] + register + P1-gap and layer_a={0} (p3b_s5_r6_verify.py l.159/163): the object is always at index 0 by construction

== C  reader: reader_plan_check (defence in depth) and run grammar
  valid                                      -> (True, None)
  no plan                                    -> (False, 'no frozen revision-6 plan for this batch')
  plan of another batch                      -> (False, 'no frozen revision-6 plan for this batch')
  unplanned run                              -> (False, 'run not in the frozen plan')
  synthesis run reads                        -> (False, 'synthesis runs may not read (records-only synthesis)')
  file not permitted                         -> (False, 'file not permitted for this run')
  forged --label                             -> (False, "--label differs from the run's plan owner")
  other label's unit, correct owner label    -> (True, None)
  run OB9011-R2          paged-mode grammar True   plain-mode grammar True   plan check applies: False
  run OB9011-R2.1        paged-mode grammar True   plain-mode grammar True   plan check applies: False
  run OB9011-R2S         paged-mode grammar True   plain-mode grammar True   plan check applies: False
  run OB9011-R6-L03U01   paged-mode grammar True   plain-mode grammar False  plan check applies: True
  run OB9011-R7-L01      paged-mode grammar False  plain-mode grammar False  plan check applies: False
  run OB9011-R5-L01      paged-mode grammar False  plain-mode grammar False  plan check applies: False
  reader plan path  : _batch_input_r2/s5/rev6/{batch}.R6-PLAN.json
  verifier plan path: <manifest header slice_root, default _batch_input_r2/s5>/<batch>.R6-PLAN.json (reader does not check the manifest-bound r6_plan_sha256)

